# Privacy (every change)

Default path: the policy never leaves the device. Rule drafts use no AI.
The CLI never calls AI.

- No new outbound network call, origin, or leave-device path without an
  ADR and a PR privacy check ([ADR 0003](../../docs/adr/0003-local-only-privacy-model.md)).
- AI keys stay in the browser (tab, or optional device remember). Never
  write a key into the project, autosave, catalog, library, exports,
  fixtures (beyond the existing `sk-test` placeholder), or this repo.
- Ollama is localhost only: `http://localhost:11434` /
  `http://127.0.0.1:11434`. Do not point it at a remote host
  ([ADR 0004](../../docs/adr/0004-ollama-localhost-only.md)).

Web, CSP, fonts, and `codify-web` bind rules: `.cursor/rules/privacy-web.mdc`.
